WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:07.426
Strategies turns your pack's own numbers into real bidding moves for where your seniority lands this month.

00:00:07.426 --> 00:00:16.881
It starts with your real place — not just your number on the list, but where you stand once you count who's above you and not bidding a line.

00:00:17.581 --> 00:00:26.678
Then it lays out the moves that apply to you, with the steps and the lines to bid for each, and whether each line is likely to still be open.

00:00:27.378 --> 00:00:37.350
The vacation slide finder tries every legal slide of your vacation on your top lines and shows which one adds the most days off or banks the most pay.

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:40.674
Drag it along the calendar to see it for yourself.

00:00:43.454 --> 00:00:49.442
And as pilots report what they held, you'll see what pilots near your seniority actually got.

00:00:50.142 --> 00:00:53.991
These are worked out from the pack, not the official rules —

00:00:53.991 --> 00:00:57.198
check anything you're unsure of with your bid rep.

